  "details": "1. Click new instance\n\n2. Open the menu\n\nCan't see a group button in the list.\n\n---\n\nAs this is a change to how group instances are classed by VRChat.\n\nCan we have a small temporary hint that tells us group instances have moved else where? To help with peoples muscle memory and how they think of instances.\n\nWe think of group Instances as a type of Instance. Giving us a one time notification for older players, that can be easily removed 10 updates down the line, helps those with muscle memory and makes this a less jarring experience for older players.",
